<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reminders</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts for typography and handwriting style -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #111827;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .main-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1280px;
      min-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.35fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    /* Left Panel Styling */
    .left-panel {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 24px 20px 24px 12px;
    }

    .left-top-text {
      color: #86198f;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.38;
      max-width: 250px;
      letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    }

    .left-middle-quote {
      margin: 40px 0;
    }

    .cursive-text {
      font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
      font-size: 62px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: #000000;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .btn-be-reminded {
      background-color: #000000;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: fit-content;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-be-reminded:hover {
      background-color: #222222;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* Right Panel Styling */
    .right-panel {
      background-color: #85055b;
      border-radius: 36px;
      padding: 44px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .right-header-text {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 29px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.32;
      letter-spacing: -0.4px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      max-width: 96%;
    }

    .cards-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    /* Card Item Styling */
    .feature-card {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 26px 24px 24px 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 410px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    }

    .card-top {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .feature-tag {
      background-color: #e5e7eb;
      color: #4b5563;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      width: fit-content;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card-heading {
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111827;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.6px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .card-description {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #6b7280;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .card-quote {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #111827;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .card-bottom {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .ready-tag {
      background-color: #e5e7eb;
      color: #4b5563;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .card-graphic {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Responsive Layout */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .main-container {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .right-panel {
        padding: 32px;
      }
      .left-panel {
        padding: 20px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .cards-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .cursive-text {
        font-size: 46px;
      }
      .right-header-text {
        font-size: 22px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <main class="main-container">
    <!-- Left Column Section -->
    <section class="left-panel">
      <p class="left-top-text">
        Tell us what you need to remember and where or when it matters. We'll take it from there.
      </p>

      <div class="left-middle-quote">
        <h1 class="cursive-text">“Be reminded<br>Not bombarded</h1>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-be-reminded">Be reminded</button>
    </section>

    <!-- Right Column Section -->
    <section class="right-panel">
      <h2 class="right-header-text">
        Your day doesn't run on a perfect schedule, so why should your reminders? Keep things flexible, stay in the moment, and let your reminders follow your life.
      </h2>

      <div class="cards-grid">
        <!-- Card 1: Location based reminders -->
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-top">
            <span class="feature-tag">Our Feature</span>
            <h3 class="card-heading">Location based<br>reminders</h3>
            <p class="card-description">
              Receive reminders when you arrive at or leave a specific location.
            </p>
            <p class="card-quote">"Buy groceries when I reach LuLu Mall."</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-bottom">
            <span class="ready-tag">We're ready</span>
            <div class="card-graphic">
              <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <g fill="#a78bfa">
                  <circle cx="50" cy="24" r="19" />
                  <circle cx="68" cy="32" r="19" />
                  <circle cx="76" cy="50" r="19" />
                  <circle cx="68" cy="68" r="19" />
                  <circle cx="50" cy="76" r="19" />
                  <circle cx="32" cy="68" r="19" />
                  <circle cx="24" cy="50" r="19" />
                  <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="19" />
                </g>
                <path d="M 50 37 Q 50 50 63 50 Q 50 50 50 63 Q 50 50 37 50 Q 50 50 50 37 Z" fill="#ffffff" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 2: Timing Meets Context -->
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="card-top">
            <span class="feature-tag">Our Feature</span>
            <h3 class="card-heading">Timing Meets<br>Context</h3>
            <p class="card-description">
              Combine time with location for smarter reminders.
            </p>
            <p class="card-quote">"At 6 PM, remind me to go to the gym if I'm still at the office."</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-bottom">
            <span class="ready-tag">We're ready</span>
            <div class="card-graphic">
              <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M50 8 
                         Q55 28 72 16 
                         Q68 36 90 32 
                         Q78 48 95 62 
                         Q74 65 78 86 
                         Q60 74 48 95 
                         Q42 74 24 84 
                         Q28 64 8 60 
                         Q26 48 12 30 
                         Q32 35 28 14 
                         Q46 26 50 8 Z" fill="#60a5fa" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
